---
/** October's two-sided, age-tailored family-ready printout. */
interface Props {storageKey?:string}
const {storageKey='omc:preview:october-sunday-reset:v1'}=Astro.props;
import FamilyActivityCalendar from '../FamilyActivityCalendar.astro';
---
<div class="osr" data-osr-key={storageKey}>
 <header class="osr-intro">
  <a href="/club">← Organized Family Club</a>
  <p class="osr-kicker">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · OCTOBER 2027</p>
  <h1>Our Family <em>Sunday Reset.</em></h1>
  <p>One weekly rhythm using your family wall calendar, with a ready-made fall project to help everyone practice.</p>
 </header>
 <div class="osr-layout">
  <aside class="osr-editor" aria-label="Prepared October Sunday Reset">
   <div class="osr-editor-head"><p class="osr-kicker">ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · OCTOBER 2027</p><h2>Our Family <em>Sunday Reset.</em></h2><button type="button" class="osr-edit-link" data-open-vision>Why this matters</button></div>
   <div class="osr-prepared" id="october-edit-controls"><span class="osr-kicker">YOUR FAMILY'S PREPARED SUNDAY RESET</span><strong>Our Sunday Reset</strong><p>Look ahead, get ready, share the work. Your first practice: getting ready for fall.</p>
    <div class="osr-summary-row"><span>Weekly rhythm</span><b data-osr-summary-trigger>Sunday after lunch</b></div>
    <div class="osr-summary-row"><span>First example</span><b data-osr-summary-lead>Getting Ready for Fall</b></div>
    <button type="button" class="osr-edit-link" data-open-editor>Edit Sunday Reset <svg aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8.2a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16.2 4 20Z"/></svg></button>
   </div>
   <p class="osr-compact-note">Keep this sheet beside your wall calendar. Everyone learns to prepare, not just Mom.</p>
   <div class="osr-actions"><div class="osr-primary-actions"><button class="osr-jump-edit" type="button" data-open-editor>Make changes</button><button class="osr-primary" type="button" data-osr-print>Print / Save PDF</button></div><button class="osr-secondary" type="button" data-osr-png>Download Sunday Reset (PNG)</button><button class="osr-reset" type="button" data-osr-restore>Restore prepared version</button></div>
  </aside>
  <dialog class="osr-dialog" data-osr-vision aria-labelledby="osr-vision-title"><div class="osr-dialog-head"><h2 id="osr-vision-title">Why this matters</h2><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close">×</button></div><p>Mom shouldn't be the only one noticing what's coming. The Sunday Reset gives the whole family a way to use the wall calendar, anticipate needs, and own preparations. The fall example is simply the first time to practice.</p><button type="button" class="osr-dialog-done" data-close-dialog>Back to our plan</button></dialog>
  <dialog class="osr-dialog osr-guided-dialog" data-osr-editor aria-labelledby="osr-editor-title">
    <div class="osr-dialog-head"><div><span class="osr-guide-kicker">MAKE IT YOURS · OCTOBER</span><h2 id="osr-editor-title">Our Family Sunday Reset</h2></div><button type="button" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close">×</button></div>
    <p class="osr-guide-intro">Your weekly rhythm and first fall example are prepared. Change only what doesn't fit.</p>
    <section class="osr-guide-section"><h3>1. When will you reset each Sunday?</h3>
      <div class="osr-choice-grid" data-osr-trigger-choices>
       <button type="button" data-osr-trigger-choice="Sunday after breakfast">After breakfast</button>
       <button type="button" data-osr-trigger-choice="Sunday after church">After church</button>
       <button type="button" data-osr-trigger-choice="Sunday after lunch">After lunch</button>
       <button type="button" data-osr-trigger-choice="Sunday evening">Sunday evening</button>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="osr-guide-section">
      <div class="osr-guide-caption"><h3>2. Everyone's weekly Sunday Reset role</h3><span>Keep and reuse</span></div>
      <p class="osr-guide-tip">These are ongoing roles for checking the calendar and preparing ahead, not fall chores.</p>
      <div class="osr-guide-jobs" data-osr-edit-assignments></div>
    </section>
    <section class="osr-guide-section">
      <div class="osr-guide-caption"><h3>3. First example: Getting Ready for Fall</h3><span>Do once</span></div>
      <p class="osr-guide-tip">We've assigned a few timely jobs. Adjust or remove anything that doesn't apply.</p>
      <div class="osr-guide-jobs" data-osr-fall-editor></div>
      <button type="button" class="osr-guide-add" data-osr-restore-fall>Restore all fall jobs</button>
    </section>
    <details class="osr-guide-more"><summary>More options</summary>
      <label>Sunday Reset cue <input type="text" maxlength="85" data-osr-custom-trigger placeholder="E.g. Sunday at 4 PM" /></label>
      <p>You can also edit printed wording directly using the pencil marks on the preview.</p>
    </details>
    <p class="osr-guide-saved">✓ Changes save automatically for this family</p>
    <button type="button" class="osr-dialog-done" data-close-dialog>Done · See our plan</button>
  </dialog>
  <section class="osr-preview">
   <div class="osr-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="October preview">
    <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="osr-panel-reset" id="osr-tab-reset" data-osr-tab="reset">Sunday Reset</button>
    <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="osr-panel-calendar" id="osr-tab-calendar" tabindex="-1" data-osr-tab="calendar">Try the Wall Calendar</button>
   </div>
   <div id="osr-panel-reset" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="osr-tab-reset" data-osr-panel="reset">
   <button type="button" class="osr-floating-edit" data-open-editor><svg aria-hidden="true" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m15 5 4 4M4 20l4-.8L19 8.2a2.1 2.1 0 0 0-3-3L5 16.2 4 20Z"/></svg><span>MAKE CHANGES</span></button>
   
   <div class="osr-stage" data-osr-stage>
    <div class="osr-pages" data-osr-pages>
     <article class="osr-paper osr-front" data-osr-front>
      <header class="osr-paper-head"><p>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · OCTOBER 2027</p><h2>Our Family <em>Sunday Reset</em></h2><span data-osr-family contenteditable="true" role="textbox" spellcheck="true" aria-label="Edit family">Look ahead. Get ready. Share the work.</span></header>
      <section class="osr-cue"><span>OUR WEEKLY FAMILY RHYTHM</span><strong data-osr-cue contenteditable="true" role="textbox" spellcheck="true" aria-label="Edit cue" >Sunday after lunch</strong><p>Spend 10–15 minutes with our wall calendar. Everyone looks ahead and prepares their part.</p></section>
      <p class="osr-sheet-caption">Every Sunday, three simple steps.</p><div class="osr-three">
       <div><img src="/images/club/october/what-is-coming.webp" alt="" width="74" height="74"/><span>01</span><strong>Look Ahead</strong><p>What's coming up this week? Look at our wall calendar.</p></div>
       <div><img src="/images/club/october/what-will-I-need.webp" alt="" width="74" height="74"/><span>02</span><strong>Prepare Early</strong><p>What can we pack, check, or prepare before we need it?</p></div>
       <div><img src="/images/club/october/what-can-I-prepare.webp" alt="" width="74" height="74"/><span>03</span><strong>Share the Work</strong><p>Who owns each step? Ask for help when needed.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="osr-people-head"><h3>Everyone has a part</h3><span>OUR WEEKLY ROLES</span></div>
      <div class="osr-people" data-osr-people><div class="osr-person"><strong>Our family</strong><p>Check the calendar and prepare what you need.</p></div></div>
      <div class="osr-finish"><strong>WE'RE READY WHEN…</strong><p>Something needed Tuesday? Put it in your bag Monday night. Ask for help early when you need it.</p></div>
      <footer class="osr-foot"><strong>Notice. Prepare. Take ownership.</strong><span>START ON THE BACK WITH OUR FALL EXAMPLE</span></footer>
     </article>
     <article class="osr-paper osr-back" data-osr-back>
      <header class="osr-paper-head"><p>ORGANIZED FAMILY CLUB · OCTOBER 2027</p><h2>Let's Try It: <em>Fall Readiness</em></h2><span>Our first Sunday Reset, prepared for our family.</span></header>
      <p class="osr-sheet-caption">Our first Sunday Reset, step by step.</p>
      <div class="osr-three osr-example-steps">
       <div class="osr-example-step">
        <img src="/images/club/october/what-is-coming.webp" alt="" width="74" height="74"/>
        <span>01</span><strong>Look Ahead</strong>
        <p>Cooler weather is coming. Check our calendar and think about what each person will need.</p>
       </div>
       <div class="osr-example-step osr-example-with-jobs">
        <img src="/images/club/october/what-will-I-need.webp" alt="" width="74" height="74"/>
        <span>02</span><strong>Prepare Early</strong>
        <p>Check what fits, keep what is useful, and store or donate what is outgrown.</p>
        <div class="osr-fall-sections" data-osr-fall-sections></div>
       </div>
       <div class="osr-example-step">
        <img src="/images/club/october/what-can-I-prepare.webp" alt="" width="74" height="74"/>
        <span>03</span><strong>Share the Work</strong>
        <p>Everyone owns their job. Children gather and sort; adults help with purchases and donation decisions.</p>
       </div>
      </div>
      <div class="osr-notes"><h3>Next Sunday, try it again</h3><p>Turn to the front and use the same three steps with whatever is coming up on your family's wall calendar. Your fall jobs are done once, not every week.</p></div>
      <footer class="osr-foot"><strong>We learn to think ahead together.</strong><span>ONE SUNDAY RESET · ONE FIRST EXAMPLE</span></footer>
     </article>
    </div>
   </div>
   </div>
   <div id="osr-panel-calendar" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="osr-tab-calendar" data-osr-panel="calendar" hidden>
    <FamilyActivityCalendar embedded />
   </div>
  </section>
 </div>
</div>
<style is:global>
.osr,.osr *{box-sizing:border-box}.osr{max-width:1480px;margin:0 auto;padding:27px clamp(18px,3.5vw,52px) 70px;font-family:Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#484941}
.osr-intro{max-width:790px;margin-bottom:34px}.osr-intro>a{font-size:12px;color:#43493f;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:25px}.osr-kicker{font-size:10px!important;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;color:#718569}.osr-intro h1{font:400 clamp(38px,4.4vw,60px)/1.14 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.osr-intro h1 em{color:#788e72}.osr-intro>p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75}
.osr-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(275px,350px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(25px,4vw,60px);align-items:start}
.osr-editor{border-top:8px solid #d8e6df;padding-top:16px}.osr-editor h2{font:italic 30px Georgia,serif;color:#668075;margin:10px 0}.osr-editor>p:nth-of-type(2){font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}.osr-editor label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin:17px 0}.osr-editor select,.osr-editor input{display:block;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:9px;border:1px solid #b8c5bd;background:white;color:#424c43;font:12px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:8px}
.osr-editor details{border:1px solid #d7e1dc;border-radius:6px;margin:21px 0;padding:0 13px}.osr-editor summary{padding:15px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.osr-editor details>p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6}.osr-edit-entry{border-top:1px solid #e2e8e3;padding:10px 0}.osr-edit-entry label{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:11px}.osr-edit-entry input{margin-top:5px}.osr-note{background:#f3f5ef;padding:17px;margin:20px 0}.osr-note strong{font:21px Georgia,serif}.osr-note p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;margin:7px 0 0}
.osr-primary,.osr-secondary{width:100%;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.osr-primary{background:#5f7767;border:0;color:#fff}.osr-secondary{border:1px solid #b7c9bc;color:#5f7767;background:white;margin-top:9px}.osr-reset{border:0;text-decoration:underline;background:none;color:#607867;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;min-height:40px;display:block;margin:8px auto}.osr-small{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#858982}
.osr-preview{min-width:0}.osr-preview-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e1e6e3;margin-bottom:17px}.osr-preview-heading h2{font:26px Georgia,serif}.osr-preview-heading span{font-size:11px;color:#858982}
.osr-stage{width:100%;min-width:0}.osr-pages{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;align-items:flex-start}.osr-paper{position:relative;width:816px;height:1056px;transform:scale(var(--osr-scale,1));transform-origin:top left;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #e6e6e0;box-shadow:0 8px 26px #0002;background:#fff;padding:36px 48px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
.osr-paper-head{text-align:center;border-top:7px solid #deeae4;padding:12px 14px 14px}.osr-paper-head>p{font-size:10px;color:#7c9085;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:700;margin:0}.osr-paper-head h2{font:400 45px/1.1 Georgia,serif;color:#506255;margin:12px 0 8px}.osr-paper-head span{font:italic 17px Georgia,serif;color:#849487}
.osr-cue{background:#e4eee6;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;padding:18px;margin-top:17px}.osr-cue span,.osr-fall-intro strong,.osr-own span{font-size:10px;color:#59765e;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700}.osr-cue strong{display:block;color:#456249;font:27px Georgia,serif;margin:7px 0}.osr-cue p{font-size:12px;color:#647867;margin:0}
.osr-three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:18px 0}.osr-three>div{background:#faf4e7;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 10px;text-align:center;min-height:185px}.osr-three>div:nth-child(2){background:#f3e7e1}.osr-three>div:nth-child(3){background:#e9f0e7}.osr-three img{width:70px;height:70px;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin:0 auto 3px}.osr-three span{display:block;font:italic 13px Georgia,serif;color:#8f9986}.osr-three strong{display:block;font:19px Georgia,serif;color:#52685a;margin:3px 0 6px}.osr-three p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;margin:0;color:#67736a}
.osr-people-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e7e0;gap:10px}.osr-people-head h3{font:26px Georgia,serif;color:#52685a;margin:8px 0}.osr-people-head span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.11em;font-weight:700;color:#8a958b}
.osr-people{display:grid;gap:5px;margin-top:9px}.osr-person{display:grid;grid-template-columns:114px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:13px;background:#f6f7f3;border-radius:6px;padding:9px 14px;min-height:48px}.osr-person strong{font:600 13px Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;color:#47634e}.osr-person p{font:12px/1.45 Montserrat,Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;color:#555f55}.osr-person.osr-adult{background:#e8eee8}
.osr-finish{margin-top:15px;border:1px solid #d6e3d8;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 17px;text-align:center}.osr-finish strong{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#64856a}.osr-finish p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;margin:6px 0 0;color:#5d705f}
.osr-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e1e9e0;text-align:center}.osr-foot strong{font:italic 20px Georgia,serif;color:#65806c}.osr-foot span{display:block;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:700;color:#98a99b;margin-top:9px}
.osr-fall-intro{background:#edf3ec;padding:18px 21px;margin-top:20px;border-radius:9px}.osr-fall-intro p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#627368;margin:7px 0 0}.osr-fall-sections{display:grid;gap:12px;margin:18px 0}.osr-fall-sections section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:90px 1fr;align-items:center;gap:16px;border-radius:9px;padding:14px 17px;background:#faf5e9}.osr-fall-sections section:nth-child(2){background:#f2eae5}.osr-fall-sections section:nth-child(3){background:#eaf0e9}.osr-fall-sections img{width:76px;height:76px;object-fit:contain}.osr-fall-sections h3{font:23px Georgia,serif;color:#556c57;margin:0 0 7px}.osr-fall-sections p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#5e685e;margin:0}.osr-own{background:#e4eee6;padding:18px 21px;border-radius:9px}.osr-own h3{font:25px Georgia,serif;color:#4b6651;margin:6px 0}.osr-own p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#647467;margin:0}
.osr-notes{padding:12px 8px}.osr-notes h3{font:23px Georgia,serif;color:#546957;margin:9px 0}.osr-notes p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#606a60;margin:8px 0}
.osr.osr-export .osr-paper{transform:none!important;box-shadow:none!important;margin:0!important}
@media(max-width:1050px){.osr-layout{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.osr-preview{order:0;width:100%}.osr-editor{order:1;max-width:720px;width:100%}}
@page{size:letter portrait;margin:0}
@media print{html,body{margin:0!important;padding:0!important;background:white!important}body *{visibility:hidden!important}.osr-pages,.osr-paper,.osr-paper *{visibility:visible!important}.osr-pages{display:block!important;position:absolute!important;top:0!important;left:0!important;width:8.5in!important;gap:0!important}.osr-paper{position:relative!important;top:auto!important;left:auto!important;width:8.5in!important;height:11in!important;page-break-after:always!important;break-after:page!important;transform:none!important;margin:0!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact!important;print-color-adjust:exact!important}.osr-paper:last-child{page-break-after:auto!important;break-after:auto!important}}

@font-face{font-family:'OSR Gelasio';src:url('/fonts/worksheet/gelasio-400.ttf') format('truetype');font-weight:400;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'OSR Gelasio';src:url('/fonts/worksheet/gelasio-600-italic.ttf') format('truetype');font-weight:600;font-style:italic;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'OSR Montserrat';src:url('/fonts/worksheet/montserrat-400.ttf') format('truetype');font-weight:400;font-display:swap}
@font-face{font-family:'OSR Montserrat';src:url('/fonts/worksheet/montserrat-600.ttf') format('truetype');font-weight:600;font-display:swap}
.osr{font-family:'OSR Montserrat',sans-serif;--osr-accent:#cdded4}
.osr-intro h1,.osr-preview-heading h2{font-family:'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif}
.osr-intro h1 em{color:#497666;font-weight:600}
.osr-editor{border-top:9px solid var(--osr-accent);padding-top:21px}
.osr-editor h2{font:600 italic 28px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#497666}
.osr-primary{background:#454545;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
.osr-preview-heading{border-color:var(--osr-accent)}
.osr-paper{padding:24px 51px 22px;font-family:'OSR Montserrat',sans-serif}
.osr-paper-head{text-align:left;background:#edf5f0;border-top:8px solid var(--osr-accent);padding:18px 25px 17px}
.osr-paper-head>p{font-size:9px;color:#405f53}
.osr-paper-head h2{font:400 39px/1.1 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#3d6556;margin:12px 0 8px}
.osr-paper-head h2 em{font-weight:600}
.osr-paper-head span{font:italic 17px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#577669}
.osr-cue{margin:0;padding:14px 0 12px;background:transparent;border-radius:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--osr-accent);text-align:left}
.osr-cue span{font-size:9px;color:#496856}
.osr-cue strong{font:600 italic 19px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#497666;margin:6px 0 4px}
.osr-cue p{font-size:11px}
.osr-sheet-caption{font:italic 20px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#497666;margin:15px 0 8px}
.osr-three{display:block;margin:0 0 12px}
.osr-three>div,.osr-three>div:nth-child(2),.osr-three>div:nth-child(3){display:grid;grid-template-columns:25px 54px 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto;column-gap:11px;align-items:center;text-align:left;border-radius:0;background:transparent;border-top:1px solid var(--osr-accent);padding:10px 2px;min-height:0}
.osr-three img{grid-column:2;grid-row:1/3;width:48px;height:48px;margin:0}
.osr-three span{grid-column:1;grid-row:1/3;font:600 10px 'OSR Montserrat',sans-serif;color:#497666}
.osr-three strong{grid-column:3;grid-row:1;font:400 19px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#454545;margin:0 0 3px}
.osr-three p{grid-column:3;grid-row:2;font-size:11px}
.osr-people-head{border-top:1px solid var(--osr-accent);border-bottom:0;padding-top:8px}
.osr-people-head h3{font:italic 20px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#497666;margin:2px 0}
.osr-people{gap:0;margin-top:4px}
.osr-person,.osr-person.osr-adult{background:transparent;border-radius:0;border-top:1px solid var(--osr-accent);padding:8px 2px;min-height:0;grid-template-columns:115px minmax(0,1fr)}
.osr-person strong{font:600 italic 17px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#3e6c5a}
.osr-person p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.4}
.osr-finish{background:#f0f5f1;border:0;border-radius:0;padding:12px 15px;text-align:left;display:grid;grid-template-columns:127px 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px}
.osr-finish strong{font-size:9px;color:#3d6556}
.osr-finish p{font:italic 14px/1.3 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;margin:0}
.osr-foot{border-color:var(--osr-accent);padding-top:10px}
.osr-foot strong{font:600 italic 17px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#497666}
.osr-fall-intro{background:transparent;border-bottom:1px solid var(--osr-accent);border-radius:0;padding:17px 0 13px;margin:0}
.osr-fall-intro p{font-size:12px}
.osr-fall-sections{gap:0;margin:0 0 12px}
.osr-fall-sections section,.osr-fall-sections section:nth-child(2),.osr-fall-sections section:nth-child(3){border-top:1px solid var(--osr-accent);border-radius:0;background:transparent;padding:13px 2px;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,1fr);gap:11px}
.osr-fall-sections img{width:58px;height:58px}
.osr-fall-sections h3{font:400 20px 'OSR Gelasio',Georgia,serif;color:#454545;margin:0 0 5px}
